{"id":"n83418-1-7","stage":4,"title":"절로 · 自然而然地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83418-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 민준이는 공부 열심히 해요?","zh":"最近敏俊学习很用功吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"공부","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0295fd5337062b34c381.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83418-1-7-2","ko":"말도 마세요. 매일 게임만 해서 한숨이 절로 나요.","zh":"别提了，他每天只知道打游戏，真让人叹气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"말도","meaning":"真是的，不像话","explanation":"말：真是的，不像话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"9","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게임만","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한숨이","meaning":"叹气","explanation":"한숨：叹气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72460","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"절로","meaning":"自然而然地，油然而生地","explanation":"절로：自然而然地，油然而生地","readings":[{"term":"절로","audio":"/audio/29c0e730004c8be95ff6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83418","senseId":"1","lemma":"절로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"发出（한숨이 나다：叹气）","explanation":"나다：发出（한숨이 나다：叹气）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"真是的，不像话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"对某种行为未能实现表示慨叹。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"叹气","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"72460","definition":"在忧愁或放松紧张的时候，呼出长气。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"29c0e730004c8be9","term":"절로","zh":"自然而然地，油然而生地","audio":"/audio/29c0e730004c8be95ff6.mp3","entryId":"83418","definition":"不借助别的力量而自动地；或不费力气而自然地。","pronunciation":["절로"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出（한숨이 나다：叹气）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发出（한숨이 나다：叹气）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21fa276b717f433f6854.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.682,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83418","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3354,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别提了，他每天只知道打游戏，真让人叹气。","最近老得看老婆的脸色。","最近敏俊学习很用功吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别提了，他每天只知道打游戏，真让人叹气。","最近敏俊学习很用功吗？","最近老得看老婆的脸色。"],"answer":0}]}
